      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "名人极少流露出这种情怀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The Master very rarely revealed this kind of feeling.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02741",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他本不轻易动感情。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He was not someone who was easily moved by emotion.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02741",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "作为观战记者长期细心观察名人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Having long observed the Master closely as a match reporter,",
          "g": "predicate"
