    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p02741",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我对他满不在乎的神态和言辞才有所体会。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I had only then begun to understand his indifferent manner and words.",
          "g": "predicate"
